WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.811 --> 00:00:27.123
Eddy, Jeb, and Gasser were playing.

2
00:00:27.124 --> 00:00:31.399
"I love dirt," Jeb said.

3
00:00:31.399 --> 00:00:38.439
"I love jumping!" Gasser said.

4
00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:41.613
He drove fast toward a pile.

5
00:00:41.614 --> 00:00:50.506
Gasser flew through the air.

6
00:00:50.507 --> 00:00:57.449
Mr. Grill came outside.

7
00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:03.684
"Good morning, students!" he said.

8
00:01:03.684 --> 00:01:07.707
"Do we have safety class today?" Zippy asked.

9
00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:10.541
"That's so boring."

10
00:01:10.541 --> 00:01:13.588
"No," Mr. Grill said.

11
00:01:13.588 --> 00:01:17.378
"We're doing something fun today."

12
00:01:17.378 --> 00:01:20.386
"What is it?" Eddy asked.

13
00:01:20.386 --> 00:01:23.424
"Tell us!" Poppy said.

14
00:01:23.425 --> 00:01:26.101
Mr. Grill smiled.

15
00:01:26.102 --> 00:01:28.860
"I'm not telling yet.

16
00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:33.188
It's a mystery!"

17
00:01:33.188 --> 00:01:36.889
"When will you tell us?" Jeb asked.

18
00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:40.508
"This afternoon," Mr. Grill said.

19
00:01:40.509 --> 00:01:49.326
"Meet me in the parking lot."

20
00:01:49.327 --> 00:01:53.509
That afternoon the students met.

21
00:01:53.510 --> 00:02:05.715
They parked in the parking lot.

22
00:02:05.716 --> 00:02:09.009
"Um," Dipper said.

23
00:02:09.009 --> 00:02:16.475
"Where is Mr. Grill?"
